      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `summarize_text.py` that calls a hosted LLM to summarize long text, I will use the Amazon Bedrock service, which provides access to various LLMs. I will import the necessary modules from the `boto3` library to interact with Amazon Bedrock and write the code to summarize text using a specific model. </thinking>\n",
